# Phase banner

Tell people when a service or feature is being evaluated and what that means for their task.

## When to use

Use a phase banner for a clearly bounded prototype or trial that people may otherwise mistake for a stable feature. It belongs near the service header. A phase label should explain a real limitation, not decorate an already released household dashboard.

The government service-assessment rules in upstream guidance do not apply to civica.uk. Our labels describe the actual project status and must never imply a government assessment or approval.

